nly if you have time)then to Deshapriya Park,Tridhara,B.Cultural,end it at RB Av Badamtala,66 Pally,and then can walk to Chetla or can take bus to Mudiali,Shibmandir and then Suruchi circuit(might be)","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110237903758688353"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:12:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110237250391064938"],"id":"2110237250391064938","in_reply_to_user_id":"1496378617018068992","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110236496037065004","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Amit4Films Behala cluster-41 Pally,Ajeya Sanghati from Tollygungeauto,then take s31 to Chowrasta and do Barisha then after bus to Behala 14 no. do Natun Dal,and others there then will get an auto to Buroshibtala do that and end it and Suruchi\n\nRB Av-Rajdanga Naba Uday,Bosepukur ones,Ekdalia","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110237250391064938"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:04:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110235342951546903"],"id":"2110235342951546903","in_reply_to_user_id":"1496378617018068992","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":23,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110234695871136255","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@EducatedMoron also for most guys accessing metro always do DumDum cluster with Tala Prattoy at start because you need to take auto from Belgachia\n\nalso for North Kolkata cluster from Nalin Sarkar always go to Kashi Bose Lane\n\nKasba cluster should start from Rajdanga Naba Uday","url":"https://x.com/11Upla/status/2110235342951546903"},{"author_id":"1496378617018068992","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:02:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110234695871136255"],"id":"2110234695871136255","in_reply_to_user_id":"3868003454","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like